# tmux 3.8 flipped the default of `mouse` to on. With it on, iTerm2 hands
# every drag and right-click to tmux: selections turn yellow (tmux copy
# mode), vanish on release, never reach the macOS clipboard, and the
# right-click menu is tmux's instead of iTerm2's. Keep the pre-3.8
# behavior so iTerm2 owns selection and copy. Hold Option while dragging
# to bypass tmux if mouse mode is ever turned back on.
set -g mouse off
